\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Away with our fears,
\par Our troubles and tears:
\par The Spirit is come,
\par The witness of Jesus returned to His home,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The pledge of our Lord
\par To His heaven restored
\par Is sent from the sky,
\par And tells us our Head is exalted on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Our Advocate there 
\par By His blood and His prayer
\par The gift hath obtained,
\par For us He hath prayer, and the Comforter gained.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our glorified Head
\par His Spirit hath shed,
\par With His people to stay,
\par And never again will He take Him away.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Our heavenly Guide 
\par With us shall abide,
\par His comfort impart,
\par And set up His kingdom of love in the heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. The heart that believes
\par His kingdom receives,
\par His power and His peace,
\par His power and His joy's everlasting increase.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Then let us rejoice 
\par In heart and in voice,
\par Our Leader pursue,
\par And shout as we travel the wilderness through:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. With the Spirit remove
\par To zion above,
\par Triumphant arise,
\par And walk with our God, till we fly to the skies.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

